    "text": "For me, long days pedaling is a way to immerse and connect with nature and be subjected to its wonders. I saw a bobcat on Inverness Ridge, and these chance happenings draw me back out there again and again! Plus, there’s nothing like a whole day on the bike to clear the head! I needed that, and maybe need some suspension too if I do Bolinas Ridge again.\n\nAnyway, here is my very short summary of the Marin ridges:\n\nbolinas ridge  = extremely bumpy 😵‍💫\ninverness ridge = steep but views ✨\nbay ridge = always a classic 🌲",
